@startuml
title 3.8.7 Reschedule a confirmed appointment
caption UC-132 | Planned | Proposed design
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
show footbox
<style>
lifeLine {
    LineStyle 0
}
</style>
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ActorBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    GroupHeaderBackgroundColor white
}

' Source: docs/requirements/uc.md
' Main entity migration: apps/api-node/src/migrations/002_lost_found_schema.sql
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "Claimant / Finder" as Actor
participant "Proposed Appointment Reschedule" as Page
participant "Proposed Appointments API" as API
participant "Appointment Service" as Service
participant "return_appointments" as Table <<entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Open Reschedule a confirmed appointment
activate Page
Page -> API: 2: Submit mutually agreed reschedule (proposed interface)
activate API
API -> API: 3: Validate access session, role and input
alt Valid request
API -> Service: 4: Reschedule a confirmed appointment
activate Service
Service -> Table: 5: Proposed: lock accepted appointment and current version
activate Table
Table --> Service: 6: Existing confirmed attempt
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 7: Require actual participant; no completed/one-sided handover
Service -> Service: 8: Validate replacement time/place; ask counterpart to approve
Service -> Table: 9: Proposed: record linked replacement proposal and audit
activate Table
Table --> Service: 10: Pending replacement version
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 11: Only switch confirmed schedule after mutual agreement
Service --> API: 12: Replacement proposal
API --> Page: 13: HTTP 200: Replacement proposal
Page --> Actor: 14: Show authorized result
deactivate Service
else Invalid input, missing session or insufficient role
API --> Page: 4.1: Proposed rejection: invalid input / authorization
Page --> Actor: 4.2: Show appropriate error; retain form/draft
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

legend left
Scope: Planned: current cancel/recreate does not implement negotiated rescheduling. No active
replacement-proposal API.
endlegend
@enduml
